  ('a2ce6a8c-d15c-4f92-8401-644daef40447'::uuid, 'Constructed over a period spanning from 1868 to 1892. Designed by Christian Jank, a renowned architect of the time. Contributions from Eduard Riedel in the architectural design. Georg Dollmann played a significant role in the design process. Julius Hofmann was involved in the architectural planning. Recognized as an internationally important cultural heritage site. Classified as a stately castle, reflecting its grandeur and historical significance. Rated as a heritage site with a ranking of 4, indicating its high cultural value. Holds a landmark ranking of 16, highlighting its prominence in tourism and culture. Offers guided tours specifically designed for wheelchair users once a week. Provides accessible toilet facilities for visitors with disabilities. Visitors can access free internet during their visit', '[0.18147576,0.21051107,-0.06284221,-0.022384878,-0.05026584,-0.013583485,-0.102942504,0.057358123,-0.14821316,-0.031691175,-0.16365436,0.09900199,0.19392559,-0.0241589,-0.07858061,-0.15204392,0.021123081,0.13777438,0.10829318,0.061385922,-0.016365994,-0.127338,0.005033796,-0.08286908,0.117446795,-0.024521962,0.09676167,-0.035120863,0.06718729,-0.054262787,0.0004473665,0.057638098,-0.0536978,-0.16060871,-0.017296745,0.19753236,0.037215132,-0.08151166,-0.13291766,-0.098110154,-0.18017657,0.009075759,0.18657877,0.07002684,0.049808823,0.03995812,-0.119526,-0.14624506,-0.0058855023,0.046112753,-0.058299918,0.17760134,0.2579168,-0.13843575,-0.07675794,0.02752911,-0.009295154,-0.124185674,0.0012037936,-0.07591312,0.059960477,0.09961288,0.053832363,-0.11438783,-0.00074571464,0.018513296,-0.1856005,-0.19143699,0.09763679,-0.12508854,-0.038166232,-0.1542762,0.11996803,0.031338178,0.03187948,-0.1994335,-0.084970176,0.029356247,0.10108491,0.0730827,0.00491059,0.085106805,0.025365299,0.017096732,0.009833412,0.035985224,-0.06614089,-0.050892375,0.008590881,0.023816453,0.24813111,-0.06601208,-0.04002762,-0.07660929,0.058535192