  ('8dec3375-a2b1-4a2c-8cf5-437e14a65e57'::uuid, 'Approximately 56 meters tall. Made of stone. Is a bell tower (campanile). Located in Italy. Is historic. Major tourist attraction. Construction began in 1173. Construction paused for nearly 90 years due to war and instability. Completed in 1372 after over 190 years of construction. Designed by Bonanno Pisano and Giovanni di Simone, with later contributions by Tommaso Pisano. Tilted due to an uneven foundation on soft ground. Reached a maximum tilt of about 5.5 degrees before stabilization efforts. ''Straightened'' to about 4 degrees tilt after engineering interventions in the late 20th century. ''Has eight floors, including the bell chamber at the top''. ''Houses seven bells, with one added as recently as 2004''. ''Features a white marble exterior with open arched galleries on each level''. ''Part of a UNESCO World Heritage Site known for its monumental square''. ''Closed to visitors from 1990 to 2001 for structural stabilization''', '[0.016510468,0.06304213,0.040239178,0.12963381,-0.20217328,-0.008511938,-0.06675623,0.024802819,-0.12334634,0.0571473,-0.03951013,0.03137517,0.0016914457,0.041745216,-0.08714917,-0.017455764,-0.056793794,-0.008437678,-0.058357004,-0.0054172445,0.036526203,-0.07498087,0.14325777,0.1613001,-0.007091622,0.13793698,-0.10611557,0.16089022,0.03128001,-0.05291852,-0.14536129,0.13939415,-0.03611497,0.011079985,0.038937587,0.08523074,0.031228844,-0.08600328,0.003693683,-0.03326628,-0.0009506969,-0.014812179,0.14625394,0.057514574,0.026355628,0.15705848,0.0504227,-0.14282563,-0.028357748,-0.16997333,-0.023872271,0.15304068,0.13994011,-0.05354466,-0.1274814,0.13428566,-0.00070087425,-0.13763765,0.062041998,0.081340075,0.16325086,-0.05808153,-0.13797733,-0.042875182,-0.067395,0.032764044,-0.23484099,-0.13686791,0.114667684,-0.16840664,0.24348848,-0.11267944,0.053392544,0.028286392,-0.00693552,-0.110602625,0.057818837,-0.024275161,-0.12048925,-0.096772045,0.07198201,-0.10391869,0.05079622,0.09589863