  ('418d0fe2-fab4-4190-b22b-c44d87aa356d'::uuid, 'Has an elevation of 2099 meters. Is a major landmark. Is a valley. Is a natural feature. Formed by the Colorado River over millions of years. Reaches depths of over 1,600 meters. Extends for 446 kilometers in length. Spans up to 29 kilometers at its widest point. Exposes nearly 2 billion years of Earth''s geological history. Top layer composed of Kaibab Limestone from the Permian period. Established as a national park in 1919. Receives over 5 million visitors annually. Situated in northern Arizona. Lies within the Colorado Plateau region. _Hosts over 70 species of mammals, including bighorn sheep and mule deer. _Has recorded more than 1,600 plant species across life zones', '[0.12791012,0.009479308,0.14937072,0.02180054,0.027119717,-0.024651887,-0.24238354,0.007898528,-0.060133144,0.11209387,-0.027034903,-0.27893487,-0.051794637,0.03222564,-0.021360656,0.12368959,0.0026414834,-0.15749924,0.14293405,0.00540589,0.10475897,0.14315736,0.077048756,0.0051124133,-0.089308575,-0.07116677,-0.27949905,0.14068511,0.086463064,-0.0647751,-0.10210399,0.20794642,0.22641288,0.0018257382,0.06418612,0.14808716,-0.03386212,-0.074303426,0.011684221,0.032277852,0.028123187,0.011576826,0.21424259,0.023217348,-0.120061204,0.21253633,-0.020130226,0.009191963,0.040636186,0.004439788,0.06781353,0.057851415,-0.049401477,0.081914574,0.053667713,-0.05706184,-0.13857873,-0.20201777,0.013359625,0.085623816,0.22724964,-0.015060275,-0.04532934,-0.12227532,0.014024846,0.14864741,-0.29208598,-0.10153051,0.111126505,-0.21400693,0.029056506,0.08997388,-0.114603765,0.0034949544,-0.122386724,-0.08634561,-0.0038391745,0.15336792,-0.019660773,-0.17737527,0.042223338,0.16605826,0.12746441,-0.06943038,-0.034325164,-0.072012134,0.03573242,0.029788986,-0.14491639,-0.000787544,0.09736476,-0.110778295,-0.11993285,-0.08317095,-0.006907311,0.11479513,0.07137563,-0.17127551,0.07895078,-0.08183611,0.13359861,-0.02826983,-0.033160027,-0.1508627,-0.04055459,0.043133628